message:
Merge pull request #139 from XavierBeguin:feature/rework-config-info-subcommands

Basically, this:

 - moves the msnoise config show into a msnoise config get;
 - slightly reworks msnoise info and fix its behaviour in regard to
   table prefix;
 - update documentation for 1.6;
 - add more tests on the 'config' subcommand.
